    '''Import an explicitly confirmed ordered file list into a new named group. Manual common defaults and per-file overrides; no automatic grouping. 图像 导入 新建组 天体 分组 校准 Before importing, summarize the exact file scope/order, proposed grouping, equipment, calibration and relevant missing or uncertain facts; ask the user and obtain confirmation. Model knowledge or reliable web sources may inform recommendations, but adopt suggested values only after user confirmation. Unknown values are allowed: the user may leave them unknown or leave calibration unconfigured. Group identical questions across an explicit file selection rather than asking per frame. A selected Master does not mean all unknowns were accepted. Set accept_unknown=true only after explaining and confirming this request\'s specific calibration unknowns; never bypass known conflicts. Equipment specifications cannot establish actual exposure, gain, offset, temperature or Master processing history. If sources or the confirmed scope/equipment/calibration change, review the differences before import. Few-shot: \'These 147 H frames use MOANA and Master Flat A. The Master temperature is unknown. Keep it unknown and save a pending-verification relation, or leave flat unconfigured?\' Only then submit the confirmed choice. No quality analysis or calibration is executed by importing.'''
    # Parse JSON parameters
    files = json.loads(files) if isinstance(files, str) else files
    defaults = json.loads(defaults) if isinstance(defaults, str) else defaults
    calibration = json.loads(calibration) if isinstance(calibration, str) else calibration
    notes = json.loads(notes) if isinstance(notes, str) else notes
    project_id = json.loads(project_id) if isinstance(project_id, str) else project_id
    project_base_revision = json.loads(project_base_revision) if isinstance(project_base_revision, str) else project_base_revision

    await _call_tool('data_imports_import_dataset', {'request_id': request_id, 'scan_id': scan_id, 'name': name, 'files': files, 'defaults': defaults, 'calibration': calibration, 'notes': notes, 'storage_mode': storage_mode, 'accept_unknown': accept_unknown, 'project_id': project_id, 'project_base_revision': project_base_revision})


